entries[121253] = { ["name"] = "Keg Smash", ["text"] = "40 Energy Melee Range\nInstant 8 sec cooldown\nRequires Ox Stance\nYou smash a keg of brew on the target, dealing [10.00 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Min DPS * 1 + 1 * (Mainhand Min DPS / 2) ) + (Attack Power / 14) - 1))] to [10.00 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Max DPS * 1 + 1 * (Mainhand Max DPS / 2) ) + (Attack Power / 14) + 1))] damage to all nearby enemies within 8 yards. Also drenches targets in your Dizzying Haze and applies the Weakened Blows effect. Generates 2 Chi.\n\nDizzying Haze\nYou hurl a keg of your finest brew, reducing the movement speed of all enemies within 8 yards by 50% for 15 sec. Deals a high amount of threat.\n\nAffected targets have a 3% chance to have their melee attacks misfire and strike themselves instead for 1095 damage.\n\nWeakened Blows\nDemoralizes the target, reducing their physical damage dealt by 10% for 30 sec." }
